  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joining together voices, multiplying actions in Bolivia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD continues to support UNITAS&apos; human rights defenders project, building on previous pilot projects and EU-funded work in previous years. The project aims to reduce the vulnerability of Bolivian human rights defenders in a context of reduced civil society space, policies and practices that affect the exercise collective indigenous and environmental and the rights of association, expression and peaceful assembly.</narrative>
  </description>
